==Battleground==
*1 [[Sunfish Jones]] spawns as the boss after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>.
*1 [[Chickful A]] spawns after 30 seconds<sup>900f</sup>.
*2 [[Angelic Gory|Angelic Gories]] spawn after 30 seconds<sup>900f</sup>, delay 3.33~6.67 seconds<sup>100f~200f</sup>.
*2 [[Chickful A]]s spawn after 70 seconds<sup>2,100f</sup>, delay 5~10 seconds<sup>150f~300f</sup>.
*3 [[Angelic Gory|Angelic Gories]] spawn after 70 seconds<sup>2,100f</sup>, delay 3.33~6.67 seconds<sup>100f~200f</sup>.
*3 [[Chickful A]]s spawn after 120 seconds<sup>3,600f</sup>, delay 5~10 seconds<sup>150f~300f</sup>.
*4 [[Angelic Gory|Angelic Gories]] spawn after 120 seconds<sup>3,600f</sup>, delay 3.33~6.67 seconds<sup>100f~200f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Angelic Gory|Angelic Gories]] spawn after 180 seconds<sup>5,400f</sup>, delay 50~100 seconds<sup>1,500f~3,000f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Use [[Rocker Cat (Rare Cat)|Ramen Cat]] and other meatshields to stall, then spawn [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Awakened Bahamut Cat]] to [[:Category:Rusher-class Cats|rush]] and deal damage, and something else to deal with the Chickful As. Once you kill the Chickful As, you have pretty much won. Using other [[:Category:Anti-Angel Cats|anti-]][[:Category:Angel Enemies|Angel]] cats like [[Talents|talented]] [[Bishop Cat (Rare Cat)|Sanzo]] can also help [[:Category:Crowd-Controller-class Cats|crowd-control]] the Angelic Gories.

